    date: "2026-05-24"
    mode: "STANDARD"
    hot_entries_consulted: ["VAC-004", "SCAR-002", "PAT-022", "JOURNAL-043"]
    l0_abstract: "Prepared the Graphify upstream hook patch and preserved it in the SCRIBE bundle."
    pourquoi: "A local guard prevents recurrence in this workspace, but true production completion needs upstream to stop shipping hooks that return before reading stdin or depend on a `python` executable that may not exist. The preserved upstream diff keeps the PR-ready change available even without `gh` or push credentials."
    validations:
      - "upstream clone diff updates Gemini hook to consume stdin and use sys.executable"
      - "upstream clone diff updates graphify hook-check to consume stdin before silent exit"
      - "upstream clone adds regression tests for large stdin and Gemini allow command"
