      The benchmark made BM25 canonical for agent retrieval, but full SEL archival would break scribe-rag because scribe-rag consumes SEL export and relies on SEL for stateful guardrails. The final boundary keeps SEL intact under the hood and removes direct SEL context/query from agent-facing preflight documentation.
    validations:
